        <ix:header><ix:hidden><ix:footnote id="FN20240305185014079" xml:lang="en-US">Weighted average.</ix:footnote>
<ix:footnote id="FN20240305185109410" xml:lang="en-US">The effective interest rate is the rate that discounts estimated future cash payments or receipts through the contractual life of the financial instrument to its net carrying amount, and it does not necessarily reflect the contractual interest rate.</ix:footnote>
<ix:footnote id="FN20250228131240618" xml:lang="en-US">Mainly demurrage, related services and other value-added services.</ix:footnote>
<ix:footnote id="FN20250228131250890" xml:lang="en-US">Mainly lease modifications and terminations, see also Note 5.</ix:footnote>
<ix:nonNumeric name="dei:EntityIncorporationStateCountryCode" contextRef="C_20250101to20251231" id="Fxbrl_20240311224642260">IL</ix:nonNumeric><ix:footnote id="FN20260228133922999" xml:lang="en-US">Include reserves related to share-based compensation, changes in fair value of investment instruments and transactions with an interested party in prior periods.</ix:footnote>
<ix:footnote id="FN20260228191224087" xml:lang="en-US">Options&#8217; exercise price is adjusted in respect of dividend distributions.</ix:footnote>
<ix:footnote id="FN20250301115613003" xml:lang="en-US">In 2023, further to an expiration of related repurchase options, the Company concluded that certain vessels, which were previously subject to a sale and lease back transaction accounted as a secured borrowing, will be redelivered on lease maturity. Accordingly, the Company recorded US$ 46 million as a financial expense for remeasurement of the related liability (and US$ 21 million as a capital loss for derecognizing such liability and the related vessels, all with no cash impact).</ix:footnote>
<ix:footnote id="FN20260228113424103" xml:lang="en-US">In accordance with Israeli Income Tax Regulations, the Group is entitled to deduct depreciation for vessels and related equipment at a higher rate than recorded in its financial statements.</ix:footnote>
<ix:footnote id="FN20260228120949939" xml:lang="en-US">As at December 31, 2025, mainly includes receivables related to vessel owners and interest receivables. The Group&#8217;s exposure to credit and market risks is disclosed in Note 29.</ix:footnote>
<ix:footnote id="FN20260228144027720" xml:lang="en-US">Comprised of owned and right-of-use assets.</ix:footnote>
<ix:footnote id="FN20240305160718835" xml:lang="en-US"> Impairment loss in the amount of US$ 28.5 million was included in Other operating expenses.</ix:footnote>
<ix:nonNumeric name="dei:EntityCentralIndexKey" contextRef="C_20250101to20251231" id="FTc_L55z8leLDEOLH95xcRd7Fg_2_1">0001654126</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric name="dei:CurrentFiscalYearEndDate" contextRef="C_20250101to20251231" id="FTc_SlUQa5tcnkCfAeMgqDexCQ_3_1">--12-31</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric name="dei:DocumentFiscalPeriodFocus" contextRef="C_20250101to20251231" id="FTc_13UvCCWjF06u_gEieaUPKg_5_1">FY</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric name="dei:AmendmentFlag" contextRef="C_20250101to20251231" id="FNarr_Ryw112RXn0qBdx56XhH7Iw">false</ix:nonNumeric><ix:footnote id="FN20250301035543678" xml:lang="en-US">See also Notes 12(c), 14(i) and 14(j).</ix:footnote>
<ix:footnote id="FN20260228133044699" xml:lang="en-US">As at December 31, 2025, the Company&#8217;s financial statements include lease liabilities in the amount of US$ 227 million in respect of vessel charter arrangements with entities that were classified as related parties at the time of engagement. During the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, the Group paid (principal and interest) amounts of US$ 53 million and US$ 128 million, respectively, in connection with these lease liabilities.</ix:footnote>
<ix:footnote id="FN20250228125046907" xml:lang="en-US">See also Note 29 in respect of the Group&#8217;s exposure to credit, currency, interest rate and fair value risks related to investments.</ix:footnote>
