        <div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div> </td>
    <td style="width: 71.89%; vertical-align: top">
        <div style="line-height: 1.25">The leasing of a vessel for a certain purpose at a predetermined rate for a predetermined period of time
        (where the hire is an agreed daily rate) or for a designated voyage (where the hire is agreed and based on volume/ quantity of goods).</div>
        </td> </tr>
