        <div style="line-height: 1.25">Cargo that is transported using standard intermodal containers as prescribed by the International Organization
        for Standardization. Containerized cargo excludes cargo that is not transported in such containers, such as automobiles or bulk cargo.</div>
        </td> </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="width: 25.16%; vertical-align: top">
