    <td style="width: 18pt"><br/> </td>
    <td style="width: 18pt; vertical-align: top">&#8226;</td>
    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
        <div>the absence of (i) any legal proceeding pending by a governmental authority that would reasonably be expected to result in a Burdensome
        Condition (as defined in the Merger Agreement) or (ii) any condition, objection, order, injunction, decree, judgment or ruling imposing
