    <td style="width: 18pt; vertical-align: top">&#8226;</td>
    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
        <div>if the terms of engagement or employment include variable components &#8212; the possibility of reducing variable components at the
        discretion of the Board of Directors and the possibility of setting a limit on the value of non-cash variable equity-based components;
        and</div> </td> </tr>
  </table>

<div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>

<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="DSPFListTable" id="z59ab8c18c8b34dbba6168799819c642e" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, serif; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000">
