remaining terms of the Options are in accordance with the Incentive Plan, which includes conditions with respect to, among other things,
adjustments, assumption and termination of engagement.</div>

<div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>

<div style="text-align: justify; line-height: 1.25"><span style="font-style: italic">Directors&#8217; compensation</span>. Our directors
