as a director observer. A copy of the Letter of Agreements is filed as Exhibit 10.2 to this Annual Report.</div>

<div style="line-height: 1.25">&#160;</div>

<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="DSPFListTable" id="z744e8757856f4660afd4d9717fb6a886" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, serif; width: 100%; text-align: left; color: #000000">
  <tr>
    <td style="width: 36pt; vertical-align: top; font-weight: bold">D.</td>
    <td style="width: auto; vertical-align: top">
        <div style="font-weight: bold">Exchange controls</div> </td> </tr>
