      <div style="text-align:justify;margin-left:36pt;line-height:1.25"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">These Consolidated Financial Statements are presented in United States dollars, which is the Company's functional currency. All amounts are presented in US$ millions unless indicated otherwise.</span></span></div>
