                          <p style="font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif;font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 3pt">F - 18</p><div style="page-break-after:always"><hr style="border-width:0px;clear:both;margin:4px 0px;width:100%;height:2px;color:#000000;background-color:#000000"/></div><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif;text-align:right"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><strong style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt"><span style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt"><span style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">ZIM INTEGRATED SHIPPING SERVICES&#160;LTD.</span></span></strong></span></span></p><div style="width:100%"><div style="margin-top:0pt;width:100%"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-align:right">&#160;</p><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif"><strong>NOTES&#160;TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</strong></span></span></p><hr style="height:2px;color:#000000;background-color:#000000;text-align:center;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;border:none;margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:10pt;text-align:center"/></div></div><p style="margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;text-align:left;font-size:10pt">&#160;</p>
