                <div style="text-align:justify;margin-left:49.5pt;line-height:1.25">&#160;</div>
                <div style="text-align:justify;margin-left:58.5pt;line-height:1.25"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">Derivatives are recognized initially at fair value, as attributable transaction costs are recognized in profit or loss as incurred. Subsequent to initial recognition, derivatives, including embedded derivatives presented separately, are measured at fair value and changes therein are recognized in profit or loss.</span></span></div>
