            <div style="margin-left:63pt">
              <p style="margin:0pt">&#160;</p>
              <p style="font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">Amortization methods, useful life and residual values are reviewed at least each financial year end and adjusted if appropriate.</p>
