      <div style="text-align:justify;line-height:1.25;margin-left:36pt"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">The Group believes that the assumptions used in its analysis are reasonable and appropriate, considering past experience and current market trends and expectations. However, by nature, such assumptions are subject to significant uncertainties and there can be no assurance that the Group&#8217;s assumptions will materialize, or whether freight rates, charter rates and bunker costs will increase or decrease by any significant degree.</span></span></div>
