      <div style="text-align:justify;margin-left:36pt;line-height:1.25"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">During 2024 and 2023 the Board of Directors approved grants under the Company&#8217;s share option plans for employees, officers and directors (see also Note 28(b)), as detailed below:</span></span></div>
      <div style="text-align:justify;margin-left:36pt;line-height:1.25">&#160;</div>
      <div style="text-align:justify;margin-left:36pt;line-height:1.25">&#160;</div>
