              <div><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">Group retirees receive, in addition to the pension payments, benefits which consist mainly of a periodical holiday gifts and reduced- cost vouchers. The Group&#8217;s liability in respect of these benefits accumulates during the employees&#8217; service period. The contractual costs are in respect of the post-employment period, based on an actuarial calculation for existing retirees and for the serving employees entitled to this benefit according to their contractual retirement age.</span></span></div>
