      <div style="text-align:justify;margin-left:63pt;line-height:1.25"><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">Under the labour agreement, employees are entitled to the participation of the Company in education fees for their children. The provision was measured based on actuarial calculations, by applying actuarial assumptions included in section (g) below, as well as assumptions based on the Company&#8217;s experience according to the likelihood of payment of educational fees.</span></span></div>
