              <div><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">As<span style="font-weight:bold">&#160;</span>at December 31, 2025, the weighted average duration of the defined benefit plans obligation was <ix:nonNumeric id="Fxbrl_20260228152607236" name="ifrs-full:WeightedAverageDurationOfDefinedBenefitObligation2019" contextRef="C_20250101to20251231" format="ixt-sec:duryear">8.7</ix:nonNumeric> years (as at December 31, 2024 - <ix:nonNumeric id="Fxbrl_20260228152630066" name="ifrs-full:WeightedAverageDurationOfDefinedBenefitObligation2019" contextRef="C_20240101to20241231" format="ixt-sec:duryear">9</ix:nonNumeric> years). In 2026, the Group expects to pay approximately US$ <ix:nonFraction id="Fxbrl_20260228152659754" name="ifrs-full:EstimateOfContributionsExpectedToBePaidToPlan" contextRef="C_20250101to20251231" unitRef="USD" scale="6" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal">1.1</ix:nonFraction> million in contributions to the funded defined benefit pension plan.</span></span></div>
