              <div><span style="font-size:10pt"><span style="font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif">In respect of additional charter agreements the Company entered into during 2025, see also Note 1(ii)(c).</span></span></div>
            </td>
          </tr>

      </table>
    </div>
